  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Donation av medicinteknisk utrustning via Socialstyrelsen 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Donation of medical equipment via The National Board Health and Welfare (4) 2024 - Donation of medical equipment via The National Board Health and Welfare 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Donation of medical equipment, healthcare equipment or other equipment via The Swedish National Board of Health and Welfare. The funds shall be used to purchase and deliver medical equipment, healthcare equipment or other equipment to countries and/or areas affected by conflict, crisies and/or natural disasters, for example Ukraine.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;r donation av medicinteknisk utrustning, sjukv&#xe5;rdsmateriel eller annan utrustning. Medlen ska anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r medicinteknisk utrustning, sjukv&#xe5;rdsmateriel eller annan utrustning till katastrof- eller krigsdrabbade omr&#xe5;den utomlands (som uppfyller OECD/DAC:s kriterier f&#xf6;r internationellt bist&#xe5;nd), s&#xe5;som Ukraina, som f&#xf6;rmedlas via EU:s civilskyddsmekanism eller via Nato Euro-Atlantic Disaster Response Coordination Centre (EADRCC).</narrative>
  </description>
